<IndustryPage {...pageData}>
<p>UK marketing agencies operate in a fast-moving, competitive market. Clients expect real-time reporting, smooth collaboration, and professional digital experiences. Bespoke software can help you deliver all three - while reducing the manual admin that eats into your margins - but most agencies are still pulling campaign data from five different platforms into spreadsheets every month, then formatting it into reports that are already out of date by the time they're sent.</p>
<p>Off-the-shelf agency software creates friction at every turn. Reporting tools like Google Data Studio handle basic dashboards but can't produce the branded, white-label reports that retain clients and win pitches. Project management tools built for software development don't understand creative workflows, versioning of design assets, or the relationship between campaign deliverables and media spend. Client portal solutions are either too generic to impress or too expensive for mid-size agencies. The result is account managers spending two days a month per client on reporting, creative directors tracking approvals through email chains, and new business teams rebuilding pitch decks from scratch because campaign data is locked in systems that don't talk to each other.</p>
<p>We build custom software for UK marketing agencies - from client reporting dashboards and campaign management systems to white-label portals and project tracking tools. We understand agency workflows, from pitch to delivery, and we build systems that integrate with the marketing platforms your clients use. Whether it's a bespoke reporting platform that pulls data from Google Ads, Meta, LinkedIn, and your client's CRM into a single white-label dashboard, or a project management system that handles creative approval workflows with version control, bespoke software fits how your agency actually operates.</p>
<p>Agency compliance is often underestimated. GDPR requirements for handling client customer data, data processing agreements with third-party platforms, and contractual SLAs for reporting frequency all demand reliable processes. Bespoke software gives you complete control over how client data is accessed, stored, and reported on - with audit trails, role-based access, and automated data retention policies that satisfy both your clients' legal teams and your own compliance obligations.</p>
<p>A UK digital marketing agency with 15 staff was spending 40% of account managers' time on monthly client reporting - manually exporting data from six platforms and rebuilding charts in PowerPoint. We built a bespoke white-label reporting platform that connected to each data source via API, generated branded dashboards updated in real time, and allowed clients to filter and explore their own data. Account management reporting time dropped by 85%, the agency won three new retainer clients specifically because of their reporting capability, and client retention improved as transparency eliminated end-of-month surprises.</p>
<p>Marketing agencies are perfectly placed to benefit from bespoke software. Every campaign generates data across multiple platforms. The opportunity is building software that pulls that data into branded dashboards, automates reporting, and gives clients a professional, self-service experience that sets your agency apart.</p>

